  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "The land of Deep Caverns, MSM's own recipe rather than a copy of a vanilla file: stone caves with lakes of water in every cave below height 20. The noise router's final_density (msm_starter:deep_caverns/final_density) carves them; sea_level 20 with default_fluid minecraft:water makes the lakes. The surface rule (material_rule) puts bedrock at the bottom, minecraft:glowstone in patches on the cave roofs and minecraft:stone everywhere else."
